# Content-first community site

This is **Cursor New Zealand** — a fork of the Cursor Ambassador Evergreen template.

- Put community-specific data in `content/`, not in `components/`.
- Do not hardcode city, country, ambassador names, or event URLs in components.
- Prefer editing `content/site.config.ts`, `content/events.ts`, `content/ambassadors.ts`, and locale JSON over changing UI structure.
- Keep diffs minimal when pulling template updates from `upstream`.
- Run `pnpm verify` before pushing to `main`.
